(282, 1, '2026-10-13 11:03:00', '2026-10-13 11:03:00', '<h1 data-interaction-id=\"7120c8e\">Reshaping the future of Calcutta.<br></h1>\n					<p data-interaction-id=\"44c2668\">It is a long established fact that a reader will be distracted by the readable content of a page when looking at its layout.The point of using Lorem Ipsum is that it has a more-or-less normal distribution of letters.</p>\n										<a href=\"#\">\n									Click here\n					</a>\n									<img data-interaction-id=\"23c1a8c\" id=\"159\" src=\"http://localhost/adamasuniversity-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/profile.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"\" alt=\"\"/>					<img data-interaction-id=\"45db096\" id=\"160\" src=\"http://localhost/adamasuniversity-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/profile2.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"\" alt=\"\"/>					<img data-interaction-id=\"761537f\" id=\"159\" src=\"http://localhost/adamasuniversity-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/profile.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"\" alt=\"\"/>					<img data-interaction-id=\"36eca74\" id=\"160\" src=\"http://localhost/adamasuniversity-wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/profile2.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"\" alt=\"\"/>					<p data-interaction-id=\"7cf54cc\">It is a long established fact that a reader</p>\n					Play\n					Pause\n					<h3 data-interaction-id=\"b66fe31\">Latest Podcast</h3>\n					<h2 data-interaction-id=\"80a6da4\">Lorem Ipsum injected</h2>\n					<p data-interaction-id=\"d10e800\">There are many variations of passages of Lorem Ipsum available, but the majority have suffered alteration in some form, by injected humour, or randomised words which don\'t look even slightly believable.</p>\n					<p data-interaction-id=\"f3773db\">There are many variations of passages of Lorem Ipsum available, but the majority have suffered alteration in some form, by injected humour.</p>\n										<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xm